## Decisions Made

- **0.5s = "deleted shot" flag** — excluded from preview/final cut, must NOT be generated. (stitch already excludes; generation-skip = TD.)
- **Render length = episode-timeline (animatic overrides), not the plan** — render cost (8s≈2× of 4s); animatic timing is authoritative for render length (431af2a).
- **AI EP = "Pascal"** — Тео posts to team-chat as author "Pascal" (the AI-EP identity), not "Тео". Thread `bdbdafcf`.
- **Through-Polина + driver hybrid** — Polина executes (now that chat-internal is fixed); Тео drives the tail with the deterministic driver under q5б authorization where speed/cleanliness needed.
- **Animatic terminology (proposal, not yet built):** REF-animatic (ref images, AnimaticPlayer) vs Episode-Timeline (video, EpisodeTimelineSection) duplicate one `VID-animatic` contract → unify into one timeline surface POST-run ([[backlog_animatic_dedup_ref_vs_video]]).

